ntent=3DA4+Credits+Explainer&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_source=3Dcustome=
r.io ) shows every call with its model, tokens, and cost in real time.

Pricing for every model is on the catalog at openrouter.ai/models ( https:/=
/openrouter.ai/models?utm_source=3Demail&utm_medium=3Dlifecycle&utm_campaig=
n=3Donboarding_v2&utm_content=3Da4_model_diversity&utm_campaign=3DOnboardin=
g+Flow+-+v4+April+2026&utm_content=3DA4+Credits+Explainer&utm_medium=3Demai=
l_action&utm_source=3Dcustomer.io ). No minimum purchase. Credits expire af=
ter one year. If you want the lowest possible spend without micro-managing =
